WEBVTT

00:01:14.867 --> 00:01:16.994
[GROUP MARCHING NEARBY]

00:02:31.402 --> 00:02:33.195
It's beautiful here.

00:02:34.280 --> 00:02:35.906
It was our aunt's.

00:02:36.282 --> 00:02:38.284
We used to come here as kids.

00:02:39.076 --> 00:02:41.495
The Order uses it now as a safe house.

00:02:43.080 --> 00:02:44.915
What's left of us, at least.

00:02:47.209 --> 00:02:51.297
Muggles think these keep evil away,
but they're wrong.

00:02:53.841 --> 00:02:55.718
I need to talk to the goblin.

00:03:07.605 --> 00:03:08.856
How are you?

00:03:10.941 --> 00:03:12.359
Alive.

00:03:17.489 --> 00:03:18.949
You probably don't remember--

00:03:18.991 --> 00:03:22.161
That I showed you to your vault
the first time you came to Gringotts?

00:03:22.745 --> 00:03:25.873
Even amongst goblins you're famous,
Harry Potter.

00:03:29.627 --> 00:03:31.337
You buried the elf.

00:03:31.754 --> 00:03:33.005
Yes.

00:03:33.047 --> 00:03:34.757
GRIPHOOK:
And brought me here.

00:03:37.176 --> 00:03:38.469
You are...

00:03:40.387 --> 00:03:42.681
...a very unusual wizard.

00:03:50.189 --> 00:03:52.483
How did you come by this sword?

00:03:56.987 --> 00:03:58.364
It's complicated.

00:04:00.449 --> 00:04:04.119
Why did Bellatrix Lestrange think it
should be in her vault at Gringotts?

00:04:05.496 --> 00:04:07.373
It's complicated.

00:04:10.668 --> 00:04:14.254
The sword presented itself to us
in a moment of need.

00:04:14.588 --> 00:04:16.173
We didn't steal it.

00:04:19.176 --> 00:04:22.721
There is a sword in Madam Lestrange's
vault identical to this one...

00:04:22.763 --> 00:04:24.515
...but it is a fake.

00:04:24.556 --> 00:04:26.350
It was placed there this summer.

00:04:26.392 --> 00:04:29.853
-And she never suspected it was a fake?
-The replica is very convincing.

00:04:29.895 --> 00:04:33.899
Only a goblin would recognize
that this is the true sword of Gryffindor.

00:04:33.941 --> 00:04:35.776
Who is the acquaintance?

00:04:35.818 --> 00:04:40.280
A Hogwarts professor.
As I understand it, he's now headmaster.

00:04:41.073 --> 00:04:42.116
Snape?

00:04:43.409 --> 00:04:45.828
He put a fake sword in Bellatrix's vault?

00:04:46.537 --> 00:04:47.705
Why?

00:04:47.746 --> 00:04:52.334
There are more than a few curious things
in the vaults at Gringotts.

00:04:53.127 --> 00:04:56.255
And in Madam Lestrange's vault as well?

00:04:58.966 --> 00:05:00.134
Perhaps.

00:05:02.511 --> 00:05:05.931
I need to get into Gringotts.
Into one of the vaults.

00:05:06.598 --> 00:05:07.891
This is impossible.

00:05:07.933 --> 00:05:11.854
Alone, yes. But with you, no.

00:05:16.942 --> 00:05:18.569
GRIPHOOK:
Why should I help you?

00:05:18.610 --> 00:05:21.488
I have gold. Lots of it.

00:05:21.530 --> 00:05:24.575
-I have no interest in gold.
HARRY: Then what?

00:05:29.788 --> 00:05:31.290
That.

00:05:31.915 --> 00:05:32.958
That is my price.

